      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "topic",
      "text": "### 1. Annihilation",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000151"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
      "origin": "source",
      "chunkId": "c0002-flat-05",
      "annotations": [
        "repair_source_fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "source",
      "text": "Equal agents cancel. In a well-formed net from a λ-term, active replicators at the same level are equal: both nodes disappear and matching auxiliary ports reconnect. For fans, that same cancellation is applying a λ to its argument.",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000152"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
      "origin": "source",
      "chunkId": "c0002-flat-05",
      "annotations": [
        "repair_source_fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "topic",
      "text": "### 2. Erasure",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000153"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
      "origin": "source",
      "chunkId": "c0002-flat-05",
      "annotations": [
        "repair_source_fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "source",
      "text": "An eraser is distinct from its neighbour and has zero auxiliary ports, so the agent it meets has nowhere to continue through. It is deleted.",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000154"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
      "origin": "source",
      "chunkId": "c0002-flat-05",
      "annotations": [
        "repair_source_fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "topic",
      "text": "### 3. Commutation",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000155"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "fills": [],
      "need": "",
      "gapType": null,
      "origin": "source",
      "chunkId": "c0002-flat-05",
      "annotations": [
        "repair_source_fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "source",
      "text": "Distinct non-eraser agents pass through each other. How many outgoing copies you get depends on the other agent’s auxiliary ports.",
      "sourceUnitIds": [
        "u000156"
      ],
      "defines": [],
      "requires": [],
      "mentions": [],
