      "text": "flowchart TB\nE@{ shape: stadium, label: \"E\" }\nF@{ shape: triangle, label: \"F\" }\nM@{ shape: rect, label: \"subnet M\" }\nN@{ shape: rect, label: \"subnet N\" }\nE -->|\"principal ↔ principal\"| F\nF --- M\nF --- N",
